#: scenario7:scenario7_9A031404_A212_485A_951E_7A1AA5D74456
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1923fc03c4960bf0c347f678a041b75b0ea6fd8536eaf6061eb14aabd89cb71
