#: scenario7:scenario7_E2145377_DA66_4D2D_BD1F_344ABAC574D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19133dcd28695637afc965950596667ddc7eac9d432d8969537699045bf2175b
